        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9ae565ae-5cd5-55dd-b89e-195d34630897",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, Judi Barrett, Ron Barrett, Jorge Blanco, Joe Stillman, Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, John Cleese\n- Films: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs, Planet 51, The Lego Movie, 21 Jump Street, 22 Jump Street\n- Books: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\n\nFacts:\n- In 1978, Judi Barrett and Ron Barrett published the children's book \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs.\"\n- In 2009, \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\" was released as an American computer-animated science fiction comedy film loosely based on the 1978 book of the same name.\n- In 2009, \"Planet 51\" was released as a Spanish and American-British 3D computer-animated science fiction comedy film directed by Jorge Blanco and written by Joe Stillman.\n- In 2009, \"Planet 51\" starred Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, and John Cleese.\n- In 2009, Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed and wrote the animated film \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs.\"\n- In 2012, Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed the live-action comedy film \"21 Jump Street.\"\n- In 2014, Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed and wrote the animated film \"The Lego Movie.\"\n- In 2014, Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed the sequel to \"21 Jump Street,\" \"22 Jump Street.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "96f74cc4-2c79-5bba-9ba3-bdb4d9428bcf",
        "text": "Page: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs (film). Sentence: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs is a 2009 American computer-animated science fiction comedy film loosely based on the 1978 children's book of the same name by Judi and Ron Barrett.\nPage: Planet 51. Sentence: Planet 51 is a 2009 Spanish and American-British-movie 3D computer-animated science fiction comedy film directed by Jorge Blanco, written by Joe Stillman, and starring Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, and John Cleese.\nPage: Phil Lord and Christopher Miller. Sentence: They are known for directing and writing the animated films \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\" (2009) and \"The Lego Movie\" (2014), as well as directing the live-action comedy film \"21 Jump Street\" (2012) and its sequel (2014).",
